# Keep the build context small and platform-neutral. Dependencies are installed fresh
# inside the image (pnpm install --frozen-lockfile), so the host's node_modules must not
# be sent: on Windows they are links to Linux paths that cannot even be read.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.turbo
**/coverage
